BUNDLED IN THE OCR WORKER
--------------------------------------------------------------------

The app reads screen text with a separate OCR worker, a frozen Python
program in Hippocampus.app/Contents/Resources/HippocampusOCR. It
includes third-party components under their own licenses, among them:

    RapidOCR 3.9.2                     Apache-2.0
    PaddleOCR PP-OCRv6 models          Apache-2.0
    ONNX Runtime 1.30.0                MIT
    OpenCV (opencv-python-headless)    Apache-2.0
    NumPy                              BSD-3-Clause
    Pillow                             MIT-CMU
    Python                             PSF License
    PyInstaller bootloader             GPL-2.0-or-later, with the
                                       bootloader exception

Some of these components are copyleft. The opencv-python-headless
wheel brings FFmpeg (LGPL-2.1-or-later) and the x264 and x265 encoders
(GPL-2.0-or-later), along with other LGPL libraries listed in its
LICENSE-3RD-PARTY.txt. The license texts that come with each package
are in the app at
Hippocampus.app/Contents/Resources/HippocampusOCR/licenses, and the
worker's own notice is HippocampusOCR/NOTICE.md. Source code for these
components is available from their projects, and for the libraries
bundled with OpenCV from https://github.com/opencv/opencv-python.

